 =?UTF-8?q?yph=20card=20=E2=80=94=20the=20app's=20dbusmenu=20entries=20(su?=
 =?UTF-8?q?bmenus=20in=20place)=20+=20QUIT=20that=20TERMs=20the=20app's=20?=
 =?UTF-8?q?process;=20platform=20menus=20need=20QApplication=20mode,=20whi?=
 =?UTF-8?q?ch=20the=20shell=20doesn't=20run=20in?=
MIME-Version: 1.0
